# IBM Plex for everything - Sans, Serif and Mono are all in ttf-ibm-plex -
# and Noto behind it for what Plex does not cover: other scripts, CJK (the
# bulk of the size, ~300 MB; drop noto-fonts-cjk to go without), emoji.
ttf-ibm-plex
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-cjk
noto-fonts-emoji

# The VTs drawn by kmscon, in the monospace font above, instead of the
# kernel's bitmap font. Its freetype engine reads fontconfig directly.
kmscon
